-# A badge as a mini entity card — the mockup's mini('badge', glyph)
-# (30-lists.js:15). Teal, because a badge is teal in this design language
-# (DECISIONS.md:22).
-# `badges/art`, spelled out: a bare "art" resolves against the RENDERING
-# controller's view path, and this thumb is rendered from the notification
-# feed, the purchase rows and the badge picker as well as from badges/.
%span.gh-card.gh-card--badge.gh-mini-thumb
  %span.gh-card-frame
    %span.gh-card-inset{ data: local_assigns[:inner_data] }
      = render 'badges/art', badge: badge
